abstract: |2-
    The AAFC Bioinformatics Code Catalogue (ABCC) template repository provides a
    modular and extensible framework for developing reproducible data analysis
    pipelines within the AAFC-Bioinfo-AAC GitHub organization. It enables
    researchers and developers to quickly initialize new projects using
    parameterized, reusable components adaptable to diverse analytical workflows.
